          "description": "'today', 'yesterday', 'tomorrow', a weekday such as 'monday' (always the last one before today, never a coming one), or a date the person gave, as YYYY-MM-DD; null if they said nothing about the day. Copy a coming day as it is: it can't be logged, and the tool says so. At most 10 characters.",
